flowchart LR
  subgraph Definition
    M[Integrated Logic Management]
    G[Service Generator]
  end
  subgraph Runtime
    L[Logic Engine]
    C[Netty TinyRPC Communication]
    P[Traffic Profiling]
    S[Thread-Safe Scheduler]
    V[Virtual Device Provider]
  end
  M -->|LogicDefinition + ServiceDescriptor| G
  G -->|GenerationManifest + local registration| L
  L -->|InvocationRequest| C
